sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
A PATCH route changes selected fields on an existing resource while preserving fields the client did not send.

```js
app.patch("/api/events/:id", (req, res) => {
  const id = Number(req.params.id);
  const event = events.find((item) => item.id === id);

  if (!event) {
    return res.status(404).json({ error: "Event not found" });
  }

  if (req.body.title !== undefined) event.title = req.body.title;
  if (req.body.category !== undefined) event.category = req.body.category;

  return res.status(200).json(event);
});
```

**Line by line:** find the target first, stop on a missing id, check each allowed field independently, and return the updated resource. An omitted field remains unchanged.

